# Deny everything, then allow only what the image needs (the Dockerfile COPYs exactly these).
# This keeps weights, data, MLflow runs, the venv and git history out of the build context
# (models/ alone is >1 GB): weights are mounted at run time, never baked in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/defectlens
!configs/serve
!reports/frozen_thresholds.json

# even inside the allowed paths
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
